rraform-design-best-practices","03","Terraform Design Best Practices","Composing on the existing Terraform best-practices documents to empower developers and distribute the power of managing Infrastructure. In doing so, some self-service Ops and micro-services architecture were added to the mix.","terraform-design-best-practices","2021-03-31T00:00:00+02:00",[14,15,16],"content:posts:2021:03:terraform-design-best-practices.md","posts\u002F2021\u002F03\u002Fterraform-design-best-practices.md","posts\u002F2021\u002F03\u002Fterraform-design-best-practices",[46,68],{"_path":47,"_dir":48,"_draft":7,"_partial":7,"_locale":8,"title":49,"description":50,"slug":51,"createdAt":52,"duration":53,"tags":56,"tools":59,"_type":17,"_id":65,"_source":19,"_file":66,"_stem":67,"_extension":22},"\u002Fprojects\u002F2019\u002Freclameaqui-data-lake","2019","ReclameAQUI Data Lake","Containerized Data Lake running on GCP, using Kubernetes (GKE) to orchestrate Apache ecosystem components, with GCS for data storage and BigQuery as the analytical interface.\nGovernance and security fully implemented using existing Google Suite groups and users through LDAP, giving stakeholders full autonomy to consume data from the Lake (with auditing).","reclameaqui-data-lake","2019-10-02T00:00:00",{"from":54,"to":55},"2019-05-01T00:00:00","2019-09-30T00:00:00",[57,58],"cloud-native","data lake",[60,61,62,63,64],"apache spark","kubernetes","python","google bigquery","apache nifi","content:projects:2019:reclameaqui-data-lake.md","projects\u002F2019\u002Freclameaqui-data-lake.md","projects\u002F2019\u002Freclameaqui-data-lake",{"_path":69,"_dir":70,"_draft":7,"_partial":7,"_locale":8,"title":71,"description":72,"slug":73,"createdAt":74,"duration":75,"tags":78,"tools":81,"_type":17,"_id":87,"_source":19,"_file":88,"_stem":89,"_extension":22},"\u002Fprojects\u002F2018\u002Fclipping-service-news-ocr","2018","Clipping Service News OCR","Media monitoring and news clipping service automation through artificial intelligence, OCR and NLP. Delivering a higher throughput to the operation and creating a true serverless infrastructure to extend its Data Center capabilities.","clipping-service-news-ocr","2018-09-11T00:00:00",{"from":76,"to":77},"2018-03-31T00:00:00","2018-09-12T00:00:00",[57,79,80],"serverless","nlp",[82,62,83,84,85,86],"tesseract ocr","dramatiq","aws","aws ecs","noops","content:projects:2018:clipping-service-news-ocr.md","projects\u002F2018\u002Fclipping-service-news-ocr.md","projects\u002F2018\u002Fclipping-service-news-ocr",1778000257343]